          "additionalProperties": true,
          "description": "A Hungarian piece of legislation resolved via its ELI URI.",
          "properties": {
            "dataset_note": {
              "default": "Nemzeti Jogszabalytar (NJT) is Hungary's official, free-to-use national legislation database, maintained by MKIFK (Magyar Kozlonykiado es Igazsagugyi Forditokozpont Zrt.) at njt.jog.gov.hu. Hungary publishes a genuine, documented national ELI (European Legislation Identifier) URI scheme since 2023 (see /eli/urisemak). Each ELI URI resolves (HTTP 302) to a partially server-rendered HTML page. Large acts may include deferred statutory or annex blocks; hu_get_text reconstructs them via NJT internal AJAX requests. There is no documented public REST/JSON search API; the search/browse UI is an AngularJS SPA that requires a session and JavaScript; documents must be addressed by a known ELI (type + year + serial, and an issuer code for non-Act types).",
              "type": "string"
            },
